.TH SPARKY-STEREO-BROWSER 1 "October 2026" "Sparky Stereo OS" "Sparky Stereo OS Manual"
.SH NAME
sparky-stereo-browser \- Sparky Stereo OS's build of the Waterfox web browser
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sparky-stereo-browser
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fIURL\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
A web browser built from the Waterfox release by BrowserWorks, which is
based on Mozilla Firefox, for Sparky Stereo OS.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-new\-window \fIURL\fR
Open \fIURL\fR in a new window.
.TP
.B \-\-private\-window \fIURL\fR
Open \fIURL\fR in a new private window.
.TP
.B \-\-ProfileManager
Start with the profile manager.
.PP
For the full list of options, run \fBsparky\-stereo\-browser \-\-help\fR.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/lib/sparky-stereo-browser
The installation directory.
.SH SEE ALSO
.I https://sparkylinux.org
